@startuml
!theme plain
autonumber

title "Eliminar un documento (soft-delete) — DELETE /api/v1/documents/{document_id}"

actor "Orquestador" as ORQ
participant "Gin Router\n(persister:8083)" as ROUTER
participant "DocumentHandler" as HANDLER
participant "DocumentService" as SERVICE
participant "DocumentRepository\n(mongo)" as REPO
participant "MongoDB" as MONGO

ORQ -> ROUTER : **DELETE** http://persister:8083\n/api/v1/documents/{document_id}
ROUTER -> HANDLER : SoftDelete()

HANDLER -> SERVICE : SoftDelete(document_id)
SERVICE -> REPO : SoftDelete(document_id)
REPO -> MONGO : updateOne( documents,\n{document_id, deleted_at: null},\n{ $set: { deleted_at: now, updated_at: now } } )
alt documento inexistente o ya borrado
    MONGO --> REPO : 0 modificados
    REPO --> SERVICE : ErrNotFound
    SERVICE --> HANDLER : ErrNotFound
    HANDLER --> ORQ : **404 Not Found**
else eliminado
    MONGO --> REPO : 1 modificado
    REPO --> SERVICE : ok
    SERVICE --> HANDLER : ok
    HANDLER --> ORQ : **204 No Content**
end

note over MONGO
    Al setear deleted_at el doc sale del
    índice único parcial de checksum ⇒
    ese checksum vuelve a estar disponible
    (se puede re-ingerir con nuevo document_id).
end note
@enduml